<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Timoti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Pol Timoti wakai we di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1-2" />Timoti yo, na pepa magigl bogl teiga i, na Pol, Krais Jisas dedugwa yagl moglka i, pepa i ene bogl teiga. Na Jisas dedugwa yoba moglka i, God, ye nono ere yugwa yagl moglkwa i, ya Krais Jisas ede ikne unabedi nono sugl munga yagl moglkwa i, na dedebriko, kogon i ere moglka. Te, ene motnga i, nono pre meduglara i, ene na wana kaima mere yegl motnga. Na prika, nono Neno Kade God ya Yaglno Kade Krais Jisas i, ye ene mitn gogl, ere wakai ere tedre, den mudn wida di padigl tenabredi prika.<verse eid="1TI 1:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Na okna dumo Efesus kide kodidre, ede provins Masedonia enagledi erika igne, na ene ka gigledi di te, dumo Efesus mogl pai moglo diga i, ene pitnga. Ana na okna dimere yegl, erme ama kuno yegl di tenagledi prika. Ene dumo Efesus mogl pai moglsre, yoba tau ye ka mabuno kibi didre, pre mediglkwa yoba beke te meglkwa i, ene ye drano si kegl dinatnedi prika. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Yoba i, ye ege ege ka kibi kane kane, kubu kaman mere yegl bekidre, ka i kaima pamedi yoba beke te meglkwa. Ye God kamo mina okna ibo yoba kagno epigl beglkwa paugwa i kandre, yoba i kogon yegl yegl erimiwedi, yene primere ka kibi tau beke idre, i God kamo dumniwe di, di meda edigwa i pre diga. Yoba ka mabuno kibi yegl ta dikraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre, God ye yobama mogl pai eraiglmedi prukwa i, ye kamo pre medigl moglsre, mogl pai eraiglmedi prukwa. Yegl prukwa ba yoba ka mabuno kibi i digo, ye prikwa igne, ye God kamo pre mediglkwa i, u gigle dikrukwa. Ye ka i prikwa igne, ka drano di ikne ikne edidre, nonga keme digwa.<verse eid="1TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Te, na ene kogon dedidre, yoba tau ka kibi beke te meglkwa i, si kegl do diga i, ene yegl etn, God yobama ta moraiglkwa i, ye ka kibi i mane dibi, ye nonga dikre, deno muduno ikne ikne tenaiglkwa pre diga. Ye nomano mina God kamo kaima pre medigl moglsre, mabuno wakai ta pamedi praiglkwa i keme eribi, ye kaima deno muduno ikne ikne tenaiglkwa i kuno erabuka. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />God yobama yegl eraiglkwa paugwa ba yoba tau yegl ta erekrikwa. Ye mabuno wakai i kide kodidre, ka kibi, mem wakai ta paikrukwa i, yoba beke te meglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Ye God lomo, Moses okna boglkwa i, beke tomga yoba munedi prikwa, ba ye yene God lomo kaima ta pre pogl sikrikwa. Ye God lomo yegl yegl dumedi, ka gigledi digwa ba ye kaima pre pogl sikrikwa pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />God lomo pre diga i, na God lomo i, kide pame dikrika. Nono prumga God lomo i, wakai paugwa ba yoba God lomo i, kogonmo kaima siragl mere pamere yegl yoba beke tebi, i swara kuno erabuka. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Nono prumga God lomo paugwa i, yoba ta God gumuglo mina yoba du munga i pre ta paikrukwa. Ye lomo i, yoba ye kamo duglo boglkre, sedigwa i ya tadaglme yoba ye God we di prikrikwa i, kide erumiwedi praiglkwa pre paugwa. Te, yoba God mabunomo pamere erekre, di kide yei tedre, neno mano si geglkwa mo yoba pere ta si geglkwa i pre paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Te, God lomo i, yoba ta yagl abu pere ta bogl kunogl neigwa ya yagl ta yene yagl bogl mabuno kide erikwa ya yoba ta yoba pere si kane sidre, nigl kogon yoba moraiglmedi i pi topo beglkwa i pre paugwa. Te, yoba ta ye ka kibi digwa mo yoba pere kagno yoko ere kide ere teigwa i pre paugwa. Te, God lomo i, yoba mabuno kane kane ta nono ka wakai ta yoba beke tedre, erekrio dumga i ta ere meglkwa yoba i, kide erumiwedi praiglkwa pre paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Na ka wakai yoba beke tomne diga i, God kamo wakai ye na yoba di tenatnedi na dedugwa i pre diga. God kamo wakai swara i mina, God siragl mere wakai yene moglkwa i nono kan pogl sidre, ye swara kagie kade tenamga pamedi pre pogl sumga.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Na ege ege Krais Jisas, nono Yaglno Kade i, di wakai yei teiga. I siragl pre ye ere mogl, Pol na kogona wakai eratniwedi kandre, kogon wakai i na eratnedi dedidre, ama yobuglo bogl narukwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Na okna Jisas kagie ere kide ere tedre, ye yobama ere si, ere kide kaima ere teiga pre God na ere sinabuka paugwa ba ye na sikre, dem muduo narukwa. I siragl pre na mabuno kide yegl erika i, Jisas ira moglkwa i na pre pogl sikre, ye pre mediglkrika pre erika. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Na okna yegl erika ba Yaglno Kade God na yoko kaima ere wakai ere narukwa i, podo kide erukwa. Te, na Krais Jisas yugobunomo mina ede suna wigo, God erme na ye kamo pre medigl pai moratnedi ake ple di narsre, te na ye yobama dena muduna tenatnedi ake ple di nare moglkwa.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Nono ege mere dumga i, Krais Jisas ede makandigle ugwa i, ye tadaglme yoba ere inagledi umiwe dumga. Yegl dumga i, ka i kaima paugwa pre dumga. Yegl pre yoba mudu ka i kaima dimiwedi pribi, kuno erabuka. Te, tadaglme yoba meglmara suna i, na swara tadaglme podo kide ere, yoba mudu egre atne ediga. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Na yoba kide yegl moglka ba Jisas Krais na ere sinabuka i, sikre, na ere yugwa. Ye yegl erukwa i, okuo yoba ira ta aimadi kamin kor moramnedi ye pre medraiglkwa yoba i, ye kandre, nomane inaiglkwa pre erukwa. Ye nomane inaiglkwa i, na yoba kide kaima ta moglka ba Jisas tabre na ere sikre, ye komono kana Pol ere yugwa pre ye yoba ira ta okuo ye pre medraiglkwa i ama ye ere inabuka kuno erumedi nomane yegl inaiglkwa.<verse eid="1TI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Ana God moglkwa i, ye taragl mudu Kingno moglsre, aimadi kamin mogl, goglkrabuka moglkwa. Te, ye murubuglo moglkwa pre nono yoba ye ta kankrumga. Ye swara kaima God moglkwa pre nono aimadi kamin ye debie sidre, kagie kade tenamga paugwa. Kaima.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Ana wana Timoti yo, na ene dumo Efesus kogon eratnedi ka di teiga i, yoba tau okna ene God kogonmo yegl yegl eratnedi God kamo kep ere ene di teimere kuno yegl, ene eratnga pre diga. Na prika i, ye okna ene di teimere mere ene poglo di prise, kogon ere motn, ene soldia mere yegl mogl, Jisas kamo wakai i pre kuda wakai boratnedi prika. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Boglsre, ene ama God kamo pre medigl pai moglsre, den mudun pogl nenabuka i, ama boratnedi prika. Yoba tau yegl ta erekrikwa pre ye pre mediglkwa i, u kide pi kodugwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Yoba tau yegl erime diga i, ene pitnga, yagl suo Himeneus ya Aleksander ama yegl eribrika pre na ye si meda edidre, Satan ye ere kide ere tenabedi ye ogo mina yeiga. Na yegl erika i, Satan ye ere kide ere tenan, ye nomane idre, okuo God kagie ta ere kide erekrabrika pre si meda ediga.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">God yobama yoba mudu pre kamage eraiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Ana Timoti yo, ka swara ta podo kaima paugwa pre na ene God yobama di tenatnedi prika i, yegl paugwa, ene yoba di ten, ye ege ege kamage eraiglkwa paugwa. Ye God ake ple di norabedi agle didre, ye ama di wakai yei tenaiglkwa paugwa. Ye yegl ersre, te yoba mudu pre kamage ere tenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Ye yoba mudu pre kamage ersre, ama king meglkwa i ya gavman yoba ta nono bitno meglkwa i pre ama kamage ere teo do. Ye gavman yoba i pre kamage ere tebi, gavman yoba i God nomane wakai tenan, ye nomane wakai idre, nono suglno wakai moraiglkwa. Suglno wakai meglbi, nono munara kiede moglsre, mogl atne ede, God nono mabuno wakai boraiglmedi prumere i keme bogl moramga. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Nono yoba mudu pre kamage eramga i, wakai panabuka. Te, yegl erumun, God, nono ere yugwa moglkwa i, ama wakai kanabuka. <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />I siragl pre God ye yoba mudu na kana kaima paugwa i pribi, yoba mudu ere inagledi prukwa. Yegl pre nono yoba mudu pre kamage ere tenamga paugwa.<verse eid="1TI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />God swara kaima moglko, yoba ta nono auro i pi God moglmara edenabuka i ama swara kaima moglkwa. Yoba swara kaima moglkwa i, Krais Jisas pre diga. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />God ege ta paduglmere i plau dugo, Jisas yoba mudu kumapno tenagledi goglkwa. Ye goglmara i mina God ye yoba mudu ere inagledi prukwa i, i nogugl ede kodugwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Te, Jisas yoba mudu pre goglkwa kamo i, na yoba di nogugl ede tenatnedi God nana dedugwa. Na diga i, kibi dikre, kaima diga. God na kogon yegl dedidre, yoba ye Juda yoba moglkre, yugobuno pere, meda ta meglkwa i God kamo kaima paugwa i beke tebo, ye pre medraiglmedi kogon yegl narukwa.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Ana nono kamage eramga i wakai paugwa pre pre mediglkwa yoba bage bage makai simara i, yoba yagl ta moraiglkwa i yoba gumuglnomugl kamage eraiglmedi prika. Yegl eraiglmedi prika ba komono kana ye mudu meglmere God tedre, okuo kamage eraiglkwa pre diga. Te, ye yoba pere kide pre tekre, kigl nonga di tekre, kamage eraiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abu mabuno yegl eraiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Ana abu we, ye kugugl gagl edenaiglkwa i, ogono nagino wakai ere si bi dinaiglmedi prika. Ye yagl no kanaiglmedi bitno yugu bai akidre, taragl gol ya bis nugu mige podo boglkwa mo kugugl gagl mige podo boglkwa i ta edekraiglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Ye ekin wakai garamnedi pribi, ye ebrie mabuno wakai beglbi, ye ebrie mabunono i mina ye ekin wakai gaiglkwa mere yegl moraiglkwa. Abu ta ye God kamo sika sumne dinaiglkwa i, ye ebrie mabuno yegl beglbi, kuno erabuka.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Te, abu meglkwa i, ye ene makai sinaiglmara i kiede mogl, mogl atne edidre, God kamo beke praiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Ye mogl mitna edidre, God kamo beke yagl tenaiglkwa i, na mane diga. Kiede moraiglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />I siragl pre God yoba beke yogwa i, yagl Adam komono kana beke yedre, Ewa okuo beke yogwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Te, Satan yoba bakagl togwa igne i ye u Adam moglmara bakagl tekrukwa. Ye abu Ewa bakagl togo, Ewa prisre, tadaglme erukwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Yegl pre abu mogl atne edenaiglkwa paugwa ba abu ye gak kuraiglmara i, God ye ake ple di tedre, ake mitna edenabuka. God yegl erabuka ba abu ye ama God kamo pre medigl moglsre, yoba deno muduno tedre, kene ere, God mabunomo sika si moraiglkwa paugwa. Abu yegl eribi, God ye ake ple di tedre, ake mitna edenabuka.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Pre mediglkwa suglno yagl mabuno yegl eraiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Ana yoba ta ere mogl, pre mediglkwa yoba suglno yagl ta moragledi pran, ye kogon kaima ta eragledi prukwa. Ka diga i, kaima diga. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Ana pre mediglkwa yoba suglno yagl ta morabuka i, yoba ye kenaglmo sikraiglkwa mere moran, kogon i erabuka. Yagl i ye ebie swara keme morabuka paugwa. Te, ye mabuno kide ta dem muduo mina pogglau borabuka i mane didre, mabuno du ya mabuno wakai erabuka paugwa. Te, ye ama yoba yogugl ta unaiglkwa i, ka wakai di te, ere wakai ere tedre, God kamo yoba wakai ere beke tenabuka mere moran, kogon i erabuka. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Pre mediglkwa yoba suglno yagl ta morabuka i, yegl mere moglsre, te ye ama spakman ta moglkre, kuda tabre erukwa yagl moglkre, kiede morabuka paugwa. Te, ye ama yoba pere bogl nonga tabre dikre, mige moni bubuno goglkre, erabuka paugwa. Yoba yegl mere ta morabuka i keme pre mediglkwa suglno yoba morabuka paugwa.<verse eid="1TI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Ana pre mediglkwa yoba suglno yagl ta morabuka i, ye yegl mere morabuka paugwa, te ye ebie gagiglma ama suglno wakai morabuka paugwa. Te, ye gagiglma moraiglkwa i, ye mogl atne edidre, mabuno du eraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />I siragl pre yoba ta yene ebie gagiglma suglno wakai ta moglkran, ye God yobama suglno morabuka i ama ta kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Te, yoba erme iga ta pre medrabuka i, ye suglno yoba ta moglkrabuka paugwa. I siragl pre yoba erme iga pre meduglkwa i, kogon yegl ta eran, kowai Yagl Kide okna erumere yegl, ye yene pre mitna edidre, tadaglme eran, God ye ka tage te dinabuka pre diga. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Te, yagl ta kogon yegl erabuka i, yoba meda meglkwa i ye yagl wakai ta moglmedi kanibi, pra, ye kogon i erabuka. Ta manan, kowai ye Yagl Kide kitn korabara sinan, yoba ye kenaglmo sibi, kide panabuka.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nigl kogon yoba mabuno yegl eraiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Ana pre mediglkwa yoba niglno kogono yoba ta morabuka i we, ye ama mabuno du erabuka paugwa. Ye mabuno wakai yoba gumuglno mina keme eragledi erekrabuka ba ege ege erabuka moran, kogon i erabuka. Te, ye ama spak ere moglkre, mige moni pre bubuno goglkrabuka paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Ye God kamo tau okna teke paugwa ba erme prumga i ake gi di moglsre, mabuno wakai ta pamedi prumere i keme ere morabuka paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Yagl ta nigl kogon yoba yegl ta moragledi prabuka i, ene ye wakai ere kan moglsre, yoba ta ye kenaglmo sikraiglkwa mere yegl moglmedi kanibi, pra, ene ye kogon i tebi, erabuka.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Te, abu ta nigl kogon eraiglkwa i, ye mabuno du eraiglkwa paugwa. Te, ye yoba kenaglno sikre, mabuno kide ta deno muduno mina pogglau borabuka i mane di tedre, ka dimara ege ege adigl moraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Te, yagl ta nigl kogon yoba morabuka i, ye ebie swara keme moran, ye ebie gagiglma ama sugl wakai morabuka paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Yagl ta nigl kogon yoba yegl moglsre, kogon i wakai eran, yoba meda meglkwa i ye wakai kanaiglkwa. Yegl pre yagl i ye yoba meda moraiglkwa i agai gogl tekre, Krais Jisas kamo nono pre medunga i, ye di tenan, ye praiglkwa kuno erabuka.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">God kamo tau okna teke paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ana Timoti yo, na ene motnara tabre unagledi prika ba na pepa bogl ene teiga i, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />na tabre ta ukribo, ene pepa i kersre, God yobama mabuno siragl mere ta eraiglkwa paugwa i, ene pre pogl sidre, ye di tenatnga pre boglka. Na God yobama we diga i, nono God kor aimadi moglkwa i yugobunomo munga i pre diga. God yugobunomo munga i, nono God kamo kaima paugwa i, ake gi dinamga paugwa. Yugu kauglage adigl paugo, kege te mitna edimere mere yegl, nono God kamo ake mitna ede, ake gi kaima dinamga pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />God kamo tau okna teke paugwa ba erme i nogugl ede noruko, nono pre medunga i, ka kaima podo paugwa. Ka i, mabuno yegl mere paugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Jisas ye ede u yoba pidre, ede makandigle ugwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te, Jisas moglkwa i, Mudu Murubuglo i nogugl ede,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Jisas dem muduo pe kaima sumedi i nogugl edugwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Jisas makandigle wan moglkwa igne, angelo ama ye kan meglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te, Jisas swara i pre nono ye kamo i pi yoba yugobuno bage bage di tomgo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ye Jisas pre mediglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te, Jisas swara i, God ye agre i ede heven ibo pidre, kagie podo kide togwa.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Yoba ka mabuno kibi dinaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1-2" />Ana God Murubuglomo nono nogugl di norukwa i, okuo murubuglo kide ere mogl, yoba tau ka mabuno kibi beke tenaiglmedi nomane tebi, murubuglo kide ye beke tenaiglmere yegl, yoba ka mabuno kibi beke tenaiglme dugwa. Te, ye ka mabuno kibi yegl yoba beke tebi, pre mediglkwa yoba tau prisre, ye God kamo kide kodidre, ka mabuno kibi i praiglmiwe dugwa. Ana yoba ye ka mabuno kibi beke tenaiglkwa yobamo i, God kogonmo yoba meglmedi no kanaiglmedi pre, yoba ka beke tenaiglkwa ba ye ka mabuno kibi keme dinaiglkwa. Te, ye nomano kobuglo mere yegl gigle dinabuka pre ye mabuno kide eraiglkwa i agai ta goglkre, eraiglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Ye yoba ka mabuno kibi di tenaiglkwa i, Ene yagl abu bogl ikre, kaya mokna tau mawagl erio! dinaiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 4:3">Yoba ka mabuno kibi didre, Ene kaya mokna tau mawagl erio! dinaiglkwa ba kaya mokna kane kane yogwa i, yoba ta pre mediglsre, God kamo kaima i ta pre pogl sinaiglkwa i ye di wakai yei tedre, nenaiglmedi pre God ere yogwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />I siragl pre God kaya mokna kane kane ere yogwa i, wakai keme yogwa. Nono God di wakai yei tomun, kaya mokna kane kane yogwa i, i nenamga. Swara ta mawagl paikrukwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Nono kaya mokna kane kane nenamga, mawagl ta paikrukwa. I siragl pre God yene ye kamo mina di norsre, kaya mokna mudu wakai yome dugwa. Te, kaya mokna pre nono kamage ersre, God di wakai yei tomnara i mina, kaya mokna i, taragl wakai, God yene norumiwedi, i nogugl edumga.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti ye Krais kogonmo yoba wakai morabuka paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ana ene Krais Jisas kogonmo yoba wakai ta moragledi pitn, na ka tau ene yoba beke tenatnedi di teiga i, ene agroma abaroma beke tenatnga paugwa. Te, yoba okna God kamo pamere ene beke teigo, ene pre mediglsre, erme ama duglo bogl motnga ka i, ene yoba beke te motn, enene ama God kamo i mina yobuglo inatnga.<verse eid="1TI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Ene God kogonmo yegl eratnga ba yoba ka mabuno dumne didre, ka mem wakai ta paikrumere kubu kaman mere yegl, yene primere digwa i, ene prikro. Ene ka i prikre, God mabunomo duglo boragledi ersre, duo ere moglo. Yoba kigle baramnedi ogono nagino sugl mogl, ere wakai erimere mere yegl, ene God mabunomo duglo boragledi kogon podo eratnga pre diga. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />I siragl pre nono ogono nagino sugl mogl, ere wakai eramga i, wakaimo kuri ta panabuka ba nono God mabunomo duo ersre, duglo bun, i swara wakai kaima panabuka. Yegl erumun, nono erme makandigle mogl enamga i wakai moramga. Te, okuo aimadi kamin moramga igne i, taragl wakai wakai ama inamga.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Ana na ka erme diga i, kaima diga pre yoba mudu ka i kaima pamedi praiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Te, ka erme ene di teiga i, nono okna ka i prisre, God okuo taragl wakai wakai ikra norabedi kogon podo erumga. God moglkwa i, ye kor aimadi moglsre, yoba mudu ere inabuka yagl moglkwa. Ye yoba mudu ere inabuka yagl moglsre, yoba ira ta ye pre medunga i, ka kaima nono ere i kodugwa. Nono ere i kodugwa pre ye okuo taragl wakai wakai noragle dugwa ka i, nono okna ka i prisre, ye kaima ere norabedi pre gi didre, kogon podo ere umga i pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Na erme ka tau ene yoba beke tenatnedi ene di teiga i, ene yoba beke tedre, duglo bolo di to. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Yoba ta ere mogl, ene yagl kulu motnga i pre kan atne edibi, ene pre yubun dekro. Ene i pre yubun dekre, pre mediglkwa yoba ebrie mabuno siragl mere beglbi, wakai panabuka i, ene obuno di to. Ene ka dinatnara ya mogl pai eratnara i, obuno wakai di tenatnga pre diga. Te, ene yoba den mudn tedre, God kamo pre medigl moglsre, mabuno deglbi yogwa i erekre, eratnara i, ye obuno di tenatnga pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Na okuo ene motnara unaglka ba erme ene ege ege God kamo yoba kere tedre, mabunomo beke te, God kamo dumere yegl ye duglo boraiglmedi di te pai moglo. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Okna ka kep yoba ta ene pre didre, God ene yobuglo tenan, ene kogon ta eratne dugo, pre mediglkwa suglno yoba ama ye ogono i pi ene akidre, kogon yegl eratne digwa i, ene kogon i kide kodokre, aimadi ere moglo.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Ana na kogon tau ene ero diga i, ene ege ege kinan gudu pre, kogon i ere pai moglo. Ene yegl etn, pre mediglkwa yoba mudu ene kandre, ene yakinedi kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Ene ege ege ebrie mabuno siragl mere boratnga i ya te, God kamo siragl mere yoba beke tenatnga i, kan kuno ersre, God kogonmo ere moglo. Ene yegl etn, ene ka mabuno di tenga prikwa yobamo i ya, enene ama ka mabuno kibi ikra prisre, yage si dinaiglmedi ere inga mere yegl panabuka.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Timoti ye pre mediglkwa yoba i, bormai swara meglmedi kanabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Ana ene pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara suna i, yagl kidagl ta moraiglkwa i, ene ka muglkudi di tekro. Ye nomane inaiglmedi ka ta di tenatnga panan, na ninama meglmedi kandre, ye ka kiede di to. Te, yagl kulu mo kumugl gak ta suna moraiglkwa i, ye na agrama meglmedi kandre, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />abu kidagl moraiglkwa i na manama meglmedi kanatnga. Te, abai mor ta suna moraiglkwa i, na abarama meglmedi kandre, ege swara ta ye bogl mabuno kide eramnedi, nomane yegl ta ikro.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol abu werai pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Ana abu werai ta ene meglmara suna moraiglkwa i we, ye werai medugl meglbi, ene ye pre mitna edidre, ake ple di to. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Ba abu werai ta ye gagiglma mo gawama ta meglbi, ye gagiglma ya gawama i God kamo duglo boglsre, kan ikne ede, mano i ake ple di tenaiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre yoba ye yene bormai swara meglkwa i ye sugl meglbi, God mabuno i wakai kanabuka.<verse eid="1TI 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Ana na ene abu werai medugl ake ple dinaiglme diga i, na abu ta yoba bormai swara ye sugl moraiglkwa ta moglkrikwa pre ye God swara ake ple di narabedi pre moglsre, etne ya eduer God di pre, kamage ere moglkwa, abu yegl ta moran, ene ake ple di tenaiglkwa pre diga. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ba abu werai ta mabuno gua gua ere, erme makandigle gun yenabuka i keme prukwa i, ye kor moglkwa ba ye gogl kodugwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="1TI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Na abu werai ya yoba ye bogl bormai swara meglkwa pre ene ka tau di teiga i, ene ye ama beke te moglo. Beke te motn, ye prisre, duglo beglbi, yoba ye gagno ka ta sikraiglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Ba yoba ta ere mogl, yoba ta ye bogl bormai swara meglkwa i sugl moglkran, i kide panabuka. I kide panabuka ba ye nem mo mam mo agigle abauglo kaima ta morabuka i sugl moglkran, i kide kaima panabuka. Pre meduglkwa yoba yegl ta eran, ye mabuno kide kaima erukwa. Yoba pre mediglkrikwa i mabuno kide yegl ta erekriko, ye mabuno kide kaima erukwa pre ye ka pre medunga i kide kodugwa mere yegl erukwa.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Ana ene abu werai tau ake ple di tenamnedi kagno bogl atne edenaiglkwa i, abu okna yagl bage bage pikre, yagl swara keme ebie moglsre, te erme abumo i bugla yugu 60 mere ne ede mitna enabuka i, kagie beglbi, kuno erabuka. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Te, abumo i ama yoba mabuno wakai erume dibi, te ye gagiglma ama bakagl i kade edugwa ta moran, ene ye kagie boraiglkwa. Te, ye yoba yogugl wigwa i ere wakai ere tedre, mogl atne ede, pre mediglkwa yoba niglno kogono ere tedre, te yoba yubuno paugwa igne ama ake ple di tedre, ege ege mabuno wakai kane kane yegl eragledi erukwa abu ta morabuka i, ene ye kagie bogl atne edidre, ake ple di tenaiglkwa i kuno erukwa.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11-12" />Ba abu kulu tau werai moraiglkwa i, ene ake ple di tenamnedi kagno bogl atne edekrio. I siragl pre ye komono kana abu werai mogl pai moglsre, Krais kogonmo keme eramniwe di padraiglkwa, ba okuo nomane kor ta pogglau boran, ye ede yagl kor ebi, ye ka okna dimara i adigl moglkre, Krais mokono teigwa mere yegl panabuka pre yoba ye kenaglno sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Te, ene abu kulu werai meglkwa i ta ake ple di tebi, kide panabuka i, i siragl pre ye yoko keme wan moraiglkwa mabuno i beke kandre, yoba pere pere kipaimara ki yoko wan moglsre te, ye ama wan moraiglmara i, ka gua gua didre, yoba mokono ka didre, yegl ere mogl dinaiglkwa i pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Ana yegl pre na prika i, abu kulu werai moraiglkwa i, ene ake ple di tekribi, ye ede yagl kor ebi, i wakai panabuka. Ye ede yagl kor pidre, gak kuglsre, yuguno toglno sugl moraiglkwa paugwa. Yegl eribi, yoba nono kudano ikne mere yegl meglkwa i ta mabunono kandre, kenaglno sinaiglkwa i ta kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Na ka tau abu kulu werai meglkwa pre diga i, i siragl pre ye tau na dimere mere yegl ede meda mere yegl pidre, Satan duglo bogl, mabuno kide ere kodigwa pre okuo tau ama yegl ere dinaiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Ana pre meduglkwa abu swara ta moran, yene bormaimo swara ama abu werai ta moran, pre meduglkwa abu i ye yene abu werai i sugl morabuka paugwa. Yegl eran, God yugobunomo mudu meglkwa i, ye abu werai swara i we di prikre, abu werai tau yoba ye ake ple di tenaiglkwa ta moglkrikwa i, ake ple di tenaiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pre mediglkwa suglno yoba ake ple di tenaiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Pre mediglkwa suglno yoba kogon dimede erikwa i, ye pre mitna edidre, mige moni mina ake ple di tenaiglkwa paugwa. Te suglno yoba God kamo ege ege beke teigwa i, komono kana inaiglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />God kamo mina ka swara ta okna ibo yegl beglkwa paugwa, Kau ta wit mogo egran, ugla porabedi ene kane koraiglkwa i, ye dra si kegl dikre, kanige erio! Kau i egre porabara i, wit mogo tau ama i nenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 25.4</char></note> di, yegl beglkwa paugwa. Ka i, kau ye wit i nenabuka kuno erukwa pre didre, te ka ebrie mere yegl, God kogonmo yoba ye kogon eraiglmara topo inaiglkwa pre ama dugwa. Te, God kamo bage ta ama dugwa i, Kogon yoba ta morabuka i, ye topomo inabuka kuno erume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk 10.7</char></note> dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre, pre mediglkwa yoba ye suglno yoba mige moni mina ake ple di tenaiglkwa kuno kaima erukwa.<verse eid="1TI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Te, pre mediglkwa suglno yoba ta morabuka i, yoba swara keme ta ene motnara udre, suglno yoba i aglau yegl yegl erume dinabuka i, ene prikro. Yoba suo mo suota u dibi, ene pratnga. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Te, ye u dibi, suglno yoba i ta kaima tadaglme erukwa panan, pre mediglkwa yoba mudu gumuglno mina Ene aglau etniwe di, nogugl di to. Di ten, yoba mudu ama kandre, God kuduglmo gogl, mabuno kide erumere yegl ta eraiglkwa.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />God gumuglo mina ya Krais Jisas gumuglo mina ya te God angeloma gumuglno mina na ene ka gigledi di teiwa. Na pre mediglkwa suglno yoba pre ene ka magigl di teimara yegl, ene adigl mogl, yegl keme ero! Ene yoba tau mabuno wakai ere tedre, tau mabuno kide ere tedre, yegl ta erekre, mabuno kuno keme ere to. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Te, ene tabre ogon i pi yoba ta edekro. Te, yoba tadaglme eraiglmara suna moglkro. Te, ene ama tadaglme mina mogl eglke ede moglo.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Ana Timoti yo, ene nigl kor keme ne motnga i kodo, nigl wain kuri ta ama akie no. Nen, ene den biglko mina kide ta magigl magigl inga i, tau aragan erabedi prika. <verse eid="1TI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Yoba tau tadaglme erikwa i, nogugl paugwa ba yoba tau teke atne keme erikwa. Tadaglme nogugl eriko, nono kamga i, God ama okuo kan yubu sinabuka ba yoba tau tadaglme teke atne erikwa i, nono erme ta kankrumga ba God okuo yoba mabunono kan yubu sinabuka igne i keme u nogugl enabuka. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Te, yoba mabuno wakai erikwa i, ama kuno yegl mere paugwa. Yoba tau mabuno wakai erikwa i, erme nogugl eriko, kamga ba tau erme ta kankrumga. Yoba tau mabuno wakai eriko, kankrumga i, okuo God yoba mabunono kan yubu sinabuka igne, ama u nogugl enan, kanamga.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="s">Yoba kane pai, nigl kogono erikwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Ana pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara suna i, yoba pere boino paigwa i, ye bitno yoba pre i mitna edidre, kano praiglkwa paugwa. Kano ta prikribi, yoba meda meglkwa i kandre, God kagie ya nono ka pre medunga i, di kide yei te dinaiglkwa pre diga.<verse eid="1TI 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Te, yoba boi paigwa i, tau ye bitno yoba ama pre mediglkwa yoba meglkwa. Yoba yegl mere ta meglkwa i, ye ere mogl, bitno yoba i no agro meglma kodo di pre, mogl mitna ede, ye kano ta prikribi, i kide panabuka. Ye praiglkwa i, no pre mediglkwa yoba kogon ere tomga i wakai pamedi prise, ye bitno yoba moraiglkwa i, deno muduno tedre, mogl atne ede, kogon podo ere te pai moraiglkwa paugwa. Ene ka i ye beke tedre, duglo boraiglmedi di to.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mige moni bununo geglbi, ka mabuno kibi dinaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Money bags" file="hk00170b_Cropped_Money Bag.tif" size="col" loc="6.10" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="6.10" /> Nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais ka okna di norukwa i, du kaima paugwa. Ba yoba ta ka mabuno kibi digwa i, ye Jisas Krais kamo i kide kodidre, God mabunomo duglo boramga ka i ama kide kodo, ka mabuno kibi yoba beke teigwa pre ye kide erikwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />Yoba yegl ta erabuka i, nono kan pogl sinamga, ye yene pre mitna edidre, God kamo bage swara ta pre pogl sikrukwa pamedi kanamga. Yoba yegl erikwa i, ye nomane kide idre, taragl kebra mina ka drano didre, nonga didre, erikwa. Ana yoba ka mabuno kibi digwa i, ye ka drano didre, nonga didre, yegl erikwa pre yoba ye ka di teigo, prikwa yobamo i, ama ye yene ikne ikne kide pre tedre, si buno di ede pere pere pidre, ka kide di ikne ikne ede, mem ta paikrumara yoba ta meglkwa ido yoba kide meglmedi kandre, erikwa.<verse eid="1TI 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Te, na di kodiga, ka mabuno kibi beke teigwa yobamo i, ye nomano u kide pi kodugo, nonga ege ege digwa. Ka kaima pre pogl sinaiglkwa mabuno i, ye meglmara i ta paikruko, ye prikwa i, ka mabuno yoba beke tomun, mige moni tau mere noribi, i nenamniwedi prisre, yoba ka mabuno kibi beke teigwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ba nono pramga i, nono God kamo duglo boglsre, ye taragl kane kane noro kodugo, pra imnedi gun yomun, nono ka kaima wakai moramga. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Mano no kiglkwa igne, nono taragl swara kaima ta idre, ukunga. Kuno yegl mere nono goramga igne, taragl swara kaima ta idre, pikramga. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Yegl pre erme kaya mokna nenamga i ya te, kugugl gagl edinamga ama ta yenan, nono pra imnedi prisre, gun yenamga paugwa.<verse eid="1TI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Yoba ta mige moni mere kide idre, bona sinamnedi prikwa i, mabuno kide kane kane ye meglmara pogglau boglko, ye mabuno kide kan, bubuno gogl, nomane kide idre, yagl kide kitn koglmara sigwa. Yegl erikwa pre ye wakai moglkre, u kide kaima pi kodigwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />I siragl pre yoba mige moni bubuno geglkwa igne, mabuno kide kane kane plau dugwa. Yoba tau mige moni bubuno geglkwa i pre ye God kamo pre mediglkwa i kide kodo, ede eglke pidre, yubun idre, giugl kane kane prisre, erikwa.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ka las dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Yegl erikwa ba ene God yobamo motnga pre mabuno yegl eraiglmara i, ene ere dinagledi teke ede eglke pidre, God mabunomo du paugwa i duglo bogl moglo. Ene yegl ersre, God kamo pre medigl moglsre, yoba den mudn te moglo. Te, ene adigl gigledi moglsre, mogl atne ede moglo. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Nono God kamo pre medunga i, ene yoba beke tedre, God kogonmo eratnga i, yoba kuda yobuglo ere beglmere mere yegl, ene kogon podo yegl eratnga paugwa. God okna ene aimadi kamin kor moratnedi agle dugo, ene ede suna udre, yoba mere gumuglno mina di nogugl ede, God na aimadi kamin kor moraglka i, nare kodume dinga pre erme ene God na aimadi kamin kor moraglka i, narukra we di poglo di pre, erme ya okuo akie God bogl wakai kaima morabugledi ero.<verse eid="1TI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ana na erme God ya Krais Jisas gumuglno mina ene ka gigledi di tenaglka. God moglkwa i, ye taragl mudu kor meglkwa i mabuno kama si moglko, te Krais Jisas moglkwa i, ye okna Pontius Pailat gumamugl adigl moglkwa igne, ye ka wakai di nogugl ede togwa. Yegl pre na God Nem ya Krais Jisas suo akie gumuglno mina ene erme ka gigledi di teiga. <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14-15" />Na ene ka gigledi di teiga i, yegl paugwa, na ene God kogonmo siragl mere eratne diga i, ene yage sikre, God gumuglo mina aglau ere dinagledi, na dimere yegl keme ere motn, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais okuo God yene ege ta paduglmere i, unabuka pre diga. God moglkwa i, ye swara kagie kade tenamga paugwa. Ye swara taragl mudu bitno moglsre, king makandigle meglkwa i kingno moglsre, ye ama kade mogl, makandigle yoba kade meglkwa i, egre atne ede tedre, moglkwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Te, God swara i aimadi kamin moglsre, abuglagemo podo kide kaima sumara moglkwa. Ye abuglagemo sumara i, nono yoba ede magigl enamga i kuno ta erekrukwa. Te, God moglkwa i, yoba ege swara ta ye kankriko, nono ama kanamga kuno erekrukwa. Ye swara kagie kade aimadi kamin i pai moglsre, aimadi kamin taragl mudu bitno moglsre, erabuka. Kaima.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Ana yoba ta erme makandigle mige moni ya bona gana mere kan neigwa i, ene di to. Mige moni ya bona gana i, tabre bugl kide erabuka yogwa pre ye yene pre i mitna edekre, mige moni mina wakai moramnedi prikraiglkwa paugwa. God swara ake ple di noran, wakai moramnedi pribi, i swara kuno erabuka. God moglkwa i, ye nono wakai moglsre, gun yenaiglmedi taragl kane kane norukwa yagle moglkwa.<verse eid="1TI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Ana yoba mige moni mere kan neigwa i, ene ka yegl mere di tedre, ka ta ama yegl di tenatnga, ye mabuno wakai mere eribi, mige moni ye meglmara kau sumere yegl, mabuno wakai i ye meglmara kau sinabuka paugwa. Te, ye mige moni ya ki ake gi di moglkre, yoba ake ple di tenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Yegl eribi, ye taragl wakai wakai heven ibo bona sigwa mere yegl panabuka. Taragl wakai wakai i, ye okuo idre, God bogl wakai kaima moraiglkwa pre ye mabuno yegl eraiglmedi di to.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timoti yo, God ene kogon tedre, ye kamo yoba di tenatnedi dedumere mere yegl, yoba beke te pai moglo. Te, yoba tau yene nomano podo pamedi prisre, ka mabuno kibi, God kamo paikrumere mere gua gua digwa i, ene prikro. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Ye ka mabuno kibi digwa i, yoba tau ka i kaima dimedi prisre, God kamo kaima pre mediglkwa i kide kodimere ene yegl erekro. Ana na prika i, God ene yoko kaima ere wakai ere te pai morabedi prika.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>